      "note": [
        "As the LFS is a sample survey, all estimations are subject to uncertainty. Uncertainty in estimations based on fewer than 20 observations on a monthly or quarterly basis or fewer than 40 observations on a yearly basis may be considered too large and the estimation is not reported. In these cases, the value is replaced with two periods [..].",
        "For the period 2007M01–2020M12, the time series contains ´linked data´. No margins of error (uncertainty figures) are reported for the period, this is instead marked as '..' in the time series. ",
        "A small adjustment has been made in underlaying variables for the period 2021–2024, which mean that the statistics slightly differ compared to the previous table.",
        "2026-06-15: The values for 2021–2025 have been adjusted following an updated derivation (calculation method), which may result in minor deviations compared with previous publications. The adjustments are marginal and do not affect the overall trend."
